        },
        {
          "text": " Ndipo yule mwanamke akaenda akamwambia mume wake, akisema, Mtu wa Mungu alinijia, na uso wake ulikuwa kama uso wa malaika wa Mungu, wa kutisha sana; nami sikumwuliza, Umetoka wapi? Wala hakuniambia jina lake; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lakini aliniambia, Tazama, utachukua mimba, nawe utamzaa mtoto wa kiume; basi sasa, usinywe divai wala kileo, wala usile kitu kilicho najisi. Maana mtoto huyo atakuwa Mnadhiri wa Mungu tangu tumboni, hadi siku ya kufa kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo huyo Manoa akamwomba BWANA, akisema, Ee Bwana, nakuomba, yule mtu wa Mungu uliyemtuma na aje kwetu mara ya pili, atufundishe hayo yatupasayo kumfanyia huyo mtoto atakayezaliwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungu akasikia sauti ya Manoa; naye malaika wa Mungu akamwendea yule mwanamke tena alipokuwa anaketi shambani; lakini mumewe, Manoa, hakuwapo pamoja naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi huyo mwanamke akaenda haraka, akapiga mbio, na kumwambia mumewe, akisema, Tazama, huyo mtu amenitokea, huyo aliyenijia siku ile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Manoa akainuka, akamfuata mkewe, na kumfikia mtu huyo, akamwuliza, Je! Wewe ndiwe mtu yule aliyenena na huyu mwanamke? Akasema, Ndio, ni mimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manoa akasema, Basi sasa hayo maneno yako yatakapotimia, je! Huyo mtoto atakuwa wa namna gani, na kazi yake itakuwa ni nini? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika wa Mungu akamwambia Manoa, “Hebu huyo mwanamke ajihadhari na yote niliyomwambia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asile kitu chochote kitokacho katika mzabibu, wala asinywe divai, wala mvinyo, wala asile kitu chochote kilicho najisi; hayo yote niliyomwamuru na ayatunze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:15"
          },
